格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Fold completed DeepSeek Harness chat turns without replacing native renderers.","id":"gh:1337288504","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-fold-turns","slug":"leon-zym/dsh-fold-turns","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Fold completed DeepSeek Harness chat turns without replacing native renderers."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-fold-turns"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> [!WARNING]\n> ### Deprecation Notice\n> **This project is deprecated and no longer maintained.**\n>\n>"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" DeepSeek Harness natively supports folding completed turn processes starting from version `0.1.5` ("},{"id":"p3s3","text":"via built-in `turn-process` and the **Settings > General > Transcript View** `compact` / `normal` to"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"ggle).\n>\n> If you are using DeepSeek Harness `0.1.5` or later, **do not install this plugin**. If al"},{"id":"p3s5","text":"ready installed, please uninstall it:\n>\n[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"`dsh-fold-turns` is a Web plugin for DeepSeek Harness that adds automatic fold/collapse behavior to "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"completed Chat turns. It keeps the user message and final answer visible, while reasoning, context i"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"njection, and tool activity are reduced to a compact **Worked for …** row. Click the row to expand t"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"he original process whenever you need it."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- Completed turns collapse automatically.\n- Running turns stay expanded and show live elapsed time.\n"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"- The plugin leaves DSH's native content and local UI state intact when you expand or collapse a tur"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"n.\n- Incomplete or incompatible turns stay visible."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"This is a Web-only plugin. It does not change the agent's output or conversation data."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Demo"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Folded"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The intermediate process is replaced by a compact duration row while the final answer remains visibl"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"e intermediate process is replaced by a compact duration row while the final answer remains visible."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Expanded"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Click either duration row to restore the original context, reasoning, and tool activity."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Upper process | Lower process and final answer |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| [](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/leon-zym/dsh-fold-turns/main/docs/assets/demo-expand-1.png) |"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" [](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/leon-zym/dsh-fold-turns/main/docs/assets/demo-expand-2.png) |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Most users only need these commands. Install the published npm package into the DSH Web profile:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Update an existing installation:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Remove the plugin:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Restart the Web process after installing, updating, or removing the plugin. DSH composes its client "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"module list at startup."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"For local development or a downloaded release tarball instead:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Using the plugin"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"No configuration is required. Running turns stay expanded. Once an eligible turn completes, its inte"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"rmediate process folds automatically and the row shows the exact duration."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Click either duration row to expand or collapse the turn. A turn without foldable process content ge"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"uration row to expand or collapse the turn. A turn without foldable process content gets no control."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The plugin is designed to fail open. Incomplete history, unknown Chat node kinds, abnormal completio"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"n, or an incompatible DOM should leave DSH's native content visible."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"> Experimental: the plugin relies on DeepSeek Harness browser and Chat DOM contracts that are not ye"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"t stable public APIs. Keep a rollback path and recheck real conversations after every DSH upgrade."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| DSH host | Status |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| `0.1.0-rc.6` | Experimental, verified baseline |\n| Other releases | Unsupported until revalidated "},{"id":"p32s2","text":" `0.1.0-rc.6` | Experimental, verified baseline |\n| Other releases | Unsupported until revalidated |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"### Build from source"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Node `22.19+` (or `24+`) and pnpm are required:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The resulting `dsh-fold-turns-<version>.tgz` is directly installable with the tarball command above."},{"id":"p37s2","text":" `pnpm pack` runs the build through `prepack`, so a clean clone does not need checked-in `lib/` outp"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"npm pack` runs the build through `prepack`, so a clean clone does not need checked-in `lib/` output."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
